  "id": 922,
  "description": "## All Australians Welcome! 🇦🇺🦘🐨\n\n\\___________________________________________________\n\n**🚩Founded: 3rd of June 2025🚩**\n\n\\___________________________________________________\n\n### High-level Overview\n\n**📖 Guild Rules**\n- We run by **AEST** (Sydney/Melbourne) 🌏\n- Try to be active (**&gt;14 days** = kick) 🥾\n- If kicked, feel free to come back 🫶\n- Contribute wherever possible 🙏\n- Most importantly, have fun! 🥳\n- P.S. New Zealanders are also welcome 🇳🇿\n\n**🥅 Current Goals (Updated 13/04/2026)** \n- Maintain buildings&#039; conditions\n- Stock up more marks. \n\n**📢 Announcement (Updated 30/05/2026)**\n- Assaults will be running until season 10 ends.\n- Running 2 assaults weekly.\n- Energising pools and armoury items up for use.\n- All raids are paused.\n- Deputies have the authority to act in the guild&#039;s best interest.\n- Oops, accidentally messed up the time, giving less time to prepare for the Wednesday assault, my bad! I should really get ChatGPT to check over this stuff lol. It should&#039;ve been Wednesday 9PM and Sunday 9AM, will fix this next season! 🙇\n\n\\___________________________________________________\n\n### Important Schedules\n\n**🕙 Raids Schedule (Subject To Supply)**\n- Sun (TBD) - N/A\n- Sat (TBD) - N/A\n- Fri (TBD) - N/A\n- Thu (TBD) - N/A\n- Wed (TBD) - N/A\n- Tue (TBD) - N/A\n- Mon (TBD) - N/A\n\n**⚔️ Assault Schedule (Subject To Supply)**\n- Sun (Announcement) - 9PM \n- Sat (TBD) - N/A\n- Fri (TBD) - N/A\n- Thu (TBD) - N/A\n- Wed (Announcement) - 9AM \n- Tue (TBD) - N/A\n- Mon (TBD) - N/A\n\n**🏊 Energising Pool Schedule (Subject To Supply)**\n- Sun - 9PM\n- Sat - N/A\n- Fri - N/A\n- Thu - N/A\n- Wed - 9AM \n- Tue - N/A\n- Mon - N/A\n\n\\___________________________________________________\n\n### Hierarchy Progression\n\n**👑 Guild Leader Succession**\n\nIn the event that the current guild leader is unable to continue playing for various reasons for an expected prolonged period of time, he/she/they will pass on the leadership to the most capable (and willing) deputy of the guild to continue our legacy. \n\n1. FabAsianZung (03/06/2025 - Current)\n2. N/A\n3. N/A\n\n**🤴Promotion To Deputy**\n1. Up to the discretion of the leader.\n2. Be very active. \n3. Contributes. (Raids/Stockpile/Challenges) \n4. One month of experience as an Officer.\n\n**👮‍♂️Promotion To Officer**\n1. Deputies are free to decide.\n2. Be fairly active.\n3. Contributes. (Raids/Stockpile/Challenges)\n4. One month since joining the guild.\n\n**🪖Promotion To Soldier**\n1. Deputies are free to decide.\n2. Show potential to become an officer.\n3. Two weeks since joining the guild.\n\n**📃Accepting Recruit Applications**\n1. Deputies are free to decide.\n2. Combat level 60.\n\n\\___________________________________________________\n\n### Miscellaneous Extras\n\n**❓️Frequently Asked Questions**\n1. Will we be making a Discord?\n   - I don&#039;t think we will be making a Discord like other guilds have done, since the guild&#039;s original goal upon its creation was to be semi-casual. If you are looking for more competitive guilds, then there are other suitable guilds to join. \n\n2. What happens if I&#039;m not able to play for a while due to life/exam/work?\n     - Life happens, go do what you need to do. You will most likely get kicked if offline for too long, but you can always apply again.\n\n3. Can I bring my Alts to the guild?\n     - For now, feel free to bring your Alts in. But if the guild ever gets too big, I may create a branch guild where our Alts can join.",
